    <summary>Lossless Hi-Res FLAC Terminal Music Streamer, Multi-Platform Playlist Sync &amp; Live Karaoke TUI</summary>
    <description>
EchoVena is a lossless Hi-Res terminal music streamer, multi-platform (Spotify and YouTube) playlist sync engine, and 60 FPS real-time word-by-word karaoke TUI in Rust.

### Key Features
- Bit-perfect Lossless Relay Waterfall (Qobuz 24-bit/192kHz -&gt; Tidal Hi-Res -&gt; Tidal Lossy -&gt; YouTube Opus)
- Multi-Platform Playlist Sync (Spotify &amp; YouTube)
- 60 FPS live word-by-word Karaoke Stage View (TTML, RichSync, .elrc, .yrc)
- Local FLAC + .elrc Archiver
- Dynamic Provider Registry (~/.config/echovena/providers.json)
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/Ranoes/echovena/releases/tag/v1.0.0</releaseNotes>
